%% Baseline: develop@87a85aa (2026-09-01)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CondenseAndRoute
    CondenseAndRoute --> Boundary
    Boundary --> Direct: greeting
    Boundary --> Capability: capability discovery
    Boundary --> Clarify: ambiguous
    Boundary --> OutOfScope: pure statutory
    Boundary --> Escalate: personal / unsupported / needs human
    Boundary --> KnowledgeLookup: knowledge query
    KnowledgeLookup --> Finalize: structured fact hit
    KnowledgeLookup --> Retrieve: evidence required
    Retrieve --> Grade
    Grade --> AccessDenied: ACL denied
    Grade --> Rewrite: no evidence + retry remains
    Rewrite --> Retrieve
    Grade --> Generate: evidence / retry exhausted
    Generate --> Confidence
    Confidence --> Finalize: answerable + threshold met
    Confidence --> HallucinationCheck: low confidence
    Confidence --> Escalate: unanswerable
    HallucinationCheck --> Generate: failed + retry remains
    HallucinationCheck --> Escalate: failed + exhausted
    HallucinationCheck --> Finalize: passed
    Direct --> [*]
    Capability --> [*]
    Clarify --> [*]
    OutOfScope --> [*]
    Escalate --> [*]
    AccessDenied --> [*]
    Finalize --> [*]
